# Local Claude Code onboarding — kept out of the public repo
CLAUDE.md

# Local testing cheat sheet (level passwords by track) — kept out of
# the public repo since shipping these defeats the puzzle
PASSWORDS.md

# Level design roadmap — carries unshipped breadcrumb mechanisms,
# lore-arc spoilers, and credential-chain plans for upcoming levels.
# Same reasoning as PASSWORDS.md: shipping defeats the puzzle.
LEVEL_ROADMAP.md

# Playwright Test artifacts (v1.24.0+) — trace zips, screenshots,
# error-context.md, and HTML report directories generated by
# `npx playwright test`. Local-only debugging output; never commit.
# Patterns are unanchored so they match whether Playwright writes the
# dir under tests/ (the configured location) OR the repo root (which
# happens when a run is invoked from the root rather than from tests/).
test-results/
playwright-report/
tests/.playwright/
